1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,841
I was the only person

2
00:00:01,841 --> 00:00:03,260
moving in a city full of

3
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:04,088
frozen people.

4
00:00:04,388 --> 00:00:05,785
Cars stood in the middle

5
00:00:05,785 --> 00:00:06,483
of the road.

6
00:00:06,783 --> 00:00:08,138
A bird hung motionless

7
00:00:08,138 --> 00:00:09,123
above a rooftop.

8
00:00:09,423 --> 00:00:10,492
Even the water in the

9
00:00:10,492 --> 00:00:11,663
