10
00:00:11,663 --> 00:00:12,019
midair.

11
00:00:12,319 --> 00:00:13,607
But the strangest thing

12
00:00:13,607 --> 00:00:14,783
was waiting inside my

13
00:00:14,783 --> 00:00:15,343
apartment.

14
00:00:16,143 --> 00:00:17,593
I woke up on an ordinary

15
00:00:17,593 --> 00:00:18,922
Tuesday and checked my

16
00:00:18,922 --> 00:00:19,284
