41
00:00:54,353 --> 00:00:55,834
Ten minutes until what?

42
00:00:56,134 --> 00:00:57,447
I looked up at the city

43
00:00:57,447 --> 00:00:57,789
clock.

44
00:00:58,089 --> 00:00:59,387
Its hands began to move,

45
00:00:59,387 --> 00:01:00,631
even though every other

46
00:01:00,631 --> 00:01:01,497
