49
00:01:03,786 --> 00:01:04,907
“DO NOT GO HOME.”

50
00:01:05,707 --> 00:01:06,440
Behind me,

51
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:08,051
the apartment building

52
00:01:08,051 --> 00:01:09,589
door slowly opened by

53
00:01:09,589 --> 00:01:10,102
itself.

54
00:01:10,802 --> 00:01:12,033
Would you go inside to

55
00:01:12,033 --> 00:01:13,208
find out who sent the

56
00:01:13,208 --> 00:01:13,655
message,

57
00:01:13,655 --> 00:01:14,942
